msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.LAN_SETTINGS.LAN_TRANSPORT"
msgid ""
"Which network library is used for LAN games.\n"
"\n"
"LiteNetLib is the modern default transport. Riptide is the legacy LAN transport."
msgstr ""
"Biblioteka sieciowa używana w grach LAN.\n"
"\n"
"LiteNetLib to nowoczesny domyślny transport. Riptide to starszy transport LAN."

msgctxt ""
"ONI_United.STRINGS.UI.CONFIGURATION.TOOLTIPS.LAN_SETTINGS.LAN_DISPLAY_NAME"
msgid ""
"The name shown to other players when they discover or join your LAN game.\n"
